cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Hierarchical VLM-RL Pick-and-Place and Drawer Opening for the Unitree G1 Humanoid"
abstract: >-
  A vision-language model (Qwen3-VL) decomposes natural-language tasks into skill
  primitives that a cascade of reinforcement-learning policies (locomotion, arm,
  finger) executes on the Unitree G1 in NVIDIA Isaac Lab. Supports pick-and-place
  and drawer opening.
type: software
